    <skos:prefLabel>VISKOL DOO NOVI SAD SRBIJA</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:altLabel>VISKOL2003</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">VISKOL 2003 DOO deals in energy and natural gas trade.

VISKOL 2003 DOO is a member of the Central European Gas Hub &#8211; CEGH  located in Vienna, Austria.

VISKOL 2003 DOO deals with international trade in natural gas and other energy products in Europe.
</skos:definition>
